   "text": "INTO Newcastle University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nINTO Newcastle University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nNewcastle University offers world-class education at its vibrant campus in one of the UK’s favourite student cities. As a member of the Russell Group, its teaching is inspired by globally excellent research – and a Newcastle University degree is held in high regard by employers across the world.Ranked 122nd in the world (QS World University Rankings 2023).One of the top 20 universities targeted by The Times 'Top 100' employers (The Times Top 100 Graduate Employers 2020-21).5+ stars awarded for graduate employability (QS Stars University Ratings 2021).#1 UK student city (Student Hut Best for 2020).13 subjects in the top 150 in the world (QS World University Rankings by Subject 2021).\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 09:42\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 09:42\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £21,895.00\nMin: £20,590.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n14%\n4,060 of 29,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nINTO\nFounded Year\n1963\nCampus(es)\nNewcastle upon Tyne\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/01/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.intostudy.com/en/universities/newcastle-university/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a6U45h1oJCo\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jr1zXyfKMyM\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
